    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, you said Andre fits into stereotypes of \"exploitation\"? That's a bit vague. Can you be more specific about what you mean by that? Also, you mentioned Kenji is the one most likely to deviate from archetypes—is that because of his race/background, or just his personality? I'm trying to figure out if I'm being unconsciously biased in the writing itself.",
